/******************************************************************/
/***                                                            ***/
/*** PROGRAM: UTCUPMENU                                         ***/
/*** PURPOSE: TO CALL UTCUPMENUS, THE SUBPROGRAM TO UPDATE      ***/
/***          THE GLOBAL MENU WITH A NEW SYSTEM RELEASE, WITH   ***/
/***          BLANK PARAMETERS SO IT PROMPTS FOR PARMS.         ***/
/***                                                            ***/
/******************************************************************/
             PGM
             CALL       PGM(*LIBL/UTCUPMENUS) PARM('          ' +
                          '          ' ' ' '          ' ' ' ' ' ' ' +
                          '          ')
             ENDPGM
